    "body": "## Summary\n\n- Prevent `AttributeNode` re-analysis from resetting coerced bound `cpdef` methods back to uncoerced C function entries during type inference, which previously left the generated temporary pointer uninitialized and caused segmentation faults at runtime when storing or indexing bound `cpdef` methods in containers under `infer_types=True`\n- Keep tuples containing uncoerced bound C or builtin method `AttributeNode` items as Python tuples in `TupleNode.analyse_types()` instead of forming a `CTupleType`, avoiding invalid C/C++ tuple conversions and unbound C function pointer packing without `self`\n- Add regression tests covering bound `cpdef`, `cdef`, overridden subclass, and builtin methods inside lists, tuples, sets, loops, and comprehensions in `tests/run/type_inference.pyx`\n\n## Root Cause\n\n- When `AttributeNode.analyse_types()` resolves a `cpdef` method and coercion to `py_object_type` switches the node into a Python attribute lookup, a later `infer_type()` call from container or loop analysis re-ran `analyse_attribute()`, overwriting `self.entry` and `self.type` back to the `is_cmethod` C function entry and skipping Python attribute generation\n- `TupleNode.analyse_types()` checked only `is_starred`, `is_pyobject`, `is_memoryviewslice`, and `is_fused` before selecting `CTupleType`, so uncoerced bound `cdef`, `cpdef`, or builtin method `AttributeNode` items caused tuple elements to be converted to C tuples\n\n## Testing\n\nAll checks below ran locally after the final edit on macOS without `numpy` or `gdb` installed:\n\n- Reproducer and standalone C/C++ tuple checks passed without warnings or crashes\n- `python runtests.py -v \"type_inference\" \"cfunc_convert\" \"bound_builtin_methods\" \"ctuple\" \"cpdef\" \"fused_bound_functions\" \"extcmethod\"` (`711` tests passed; `numpy_ufuncs.ufunc_ctuple` excluded due to missing `numpy`)\n- `python runtests.py --no-file --no-doctest --no-examples --no-pyregr` (`292` tests ran, `2` skipped)\n- `python runtests.py -v \"fused_cmethods\" \"static_methods\" \"method_module_name\" \"inplace\" \"errors\\.\"` (`353` tests passed; `errors.nogil_buffer_acquisition`, `errors.w_numpy_arr_as_cppvec_ref`, and `errors.missing_baseclass_in_predecl_T262` excluded)\n- `python runtests.py \"for_in\" \"for_loop\" \"generator\" \"list_comp\" \"tuple_unpack\" -x \"numpy|coverage|gdb\"` (`403` tests passed; `run.generator_expressions_in_class` and `run.inlined_generator_expressions` excluded)\n\nCloses #8001\n",
